1
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:17,520
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:24,660
I kick a pebble and my shoes fly off too.

3
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:32,900
onto the head of the carpenter
I was putting in a chokehold,

4
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:39,140
they laughed that I'm still just a kid.

5
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:44,220
Even if I leave my energy somewhere,

6
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:49,300
Katsushika stays the same,
one yawn changes nothing.

7
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,180
The streetscape feels strangely gentle.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:01,120
From the pointed hat's water bottle,

9
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:07,460
the sunset falls toward the vast sky.

10
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:15,920
Tomorrow, too, it will end just like this.

11
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:21,060
Katsushika, Shibamata,
happiness is lost again.

12
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:24,600
Because I'm a fool who finally realized it.

13
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:32,200
Gracefully transforming: Gekkō Deka!

14
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,400
We're back from the special patrol.

15
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,240
Nothing to report in the east district.

16
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,800
Good work.

17
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:56,580
Senpai, it's our turn now.

18
00:01:56,580 --> 00:01:59,540
Shut up, this is an important part.

19
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:04,640
Ryo-chan, what if the Cat's Eye Thieves
show up while you're slacking off like that?

20
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:06,680
What's this about cat's balls?

21
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,560
The Cat's Eye Thieves.

22
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:15,300
They're a gang that's been specializing in stealing only
luxury items like art and jewelry in Katsushika lately.

23
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,720
They've already hit six places.

24
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:22,420
Aren't we stepping up night
patrols specifically to catch them?

25
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:25,500
Come to think of it,
the Chief did say something like that.

26
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:28,360
Damn it,
they went and increased my overtime.

27
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:31,160
I heard it's a trio of women.

28
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:34,180
Maybe there's a babe or two in there who's your type,
Ryo-chan.

29
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:44,640
I've got no interest in dumb broads
who only fawn over luxury goods.

30
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,860
Nakagawa, I'm leaving this to you.
Go on patrol alone.

31
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,480
I-I'd love to, but...

32
00:02:57,520 --> 00:03:00,180
Gibbakabōn!

33
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,440
Do you have any awareness of being a police officer,
or don't you?

34
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:08,200
You don't, do you? Of course you don't.
There's no way you would. Is that right?

35
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,780
What's this "groggy"!

36
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:14,260
Because there are people like you, headquarters
is worried and sends reinforcements.

37
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:16,980
Reinforcements?
Someone's coming from headquarters?

38
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:21,840
That's right! To solve the case related
to the Cat's Eye Thieves this time,

39
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:25,460
an elite detective with a 100%
arrest rate has been dispatched.

40
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:28,220
All of us will fall under his command.

41
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:29,620
What's his name?

42
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:34,040
I didn't catch his real name,
but at headquarters he's called Gekkō Deka.

43
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,020
Gekkō Deka?

44
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:40,360
There was that old TV show,
Gekkō Kamen, right?

45
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,800
There was also Ninja Squad Gekkō.

46
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:46,480
What are you two going on about?

47
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,080
This man is an elite detective, you know.

48
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,120
He wouldn't be dressed up in
some ridiculous getup like that.

49
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,420
So what's he like, then?

50
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,300
Well...

51
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,800
Maybe he's a handsome
detective who's also a musician?

52
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,560
Once the case is solved,

53
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,940
he'll play Beethoven's Moonlight Sonata,
I'm sure of it.

54
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,680
By the way, Gekkō Deka

55
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,740
is assigned to the Special
Investigations Division.

56
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,580
Special Investigations Division?

57
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:17,920
When you say Special
Investigations Division,

58
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:20,780
that's where Trunks Deka
and Dolphin Deka are.

59
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:23,800
Doesn't look like we can expect him to be much of a music lover,
does it?

60
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,960
I've got a headache, so I'm going home.

61
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,240
Really? Going home, Ryotsu?

62
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:33,560
There's supposed to be a special bonus when the case is solved,
you know.

63
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,420
Special bonus?

64
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,560
So we'll arrest the culprit ourselves,

65
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,420
and take the bonus all for ourselves

66
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:45,160
Senior Constable, we'd be delighted to
serve under Moonlight Detective's command!

67
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,160
Bonus, bonus!

68
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:54,100
Is the moon out?

69
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,540
It's out.

70
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:01,880
That's...

71
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:10,380
Those oblique guns mounted
on its back and fuselage.

72
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:15,480
That's the Gekkō, a night fighter that
saw action at the end of the Pacific War.

73
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:17,360
The Gekkō, you say?

74
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,540
Then the one piloting that thing is...

75
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:21,000
A Gekkō pilot?

76
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,020
Everyone, brace yourselves for the shock!

77
00:05:43,020 --> 00:05:45,980
Some outrageous pervert of
an old man is sure to show up!

78
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,980
Japan has three legendary detectives.

79
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,920
On land, there's Kaipan Deka.

80
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,960
At sea, there's Dolphin Deka.

81
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:56,300
And in the sky, yours truly.

82
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,960
I'm Gekkō Deka!

83
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,380
W-well, he seems normal, at least.

84
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:05,980
No way...

85
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:09,520
You're the officers from the
Kameari Kōen-mae Police Box, right?

86
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:12,000
I'm Gekkō Deka of the Special
Investigations Division.

87
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,600
Nice to meet you.

88
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:13,660
Nice to meet you.

89
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:15,840
And one more...

90
00:06:20,580 --> 00:06:22,960
My partner is Venus Deka.

91
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:24,880
I'm Venus.

92
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,600
Nice to meet you.

93
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:26,760
Nice to meet you.

94
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,780
So there are normal people in the
Special Investigations Division too.

95
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,020
I was caught off guard,
but in the opposite way.

96
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,460
That's not mine!

97
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:38,680
It's mine.

98
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:42,540
Looks like the Cat's
Eye Thieves have shown up.

99
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,540
Get ready to move out right away!

100
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:44,640
Yes, sir!

101
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:51,020
Aren't we heading straight to the scene?

102
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,420
But first, there's something I have to do.

103
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:55,420
Moonlight Power!

104
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:35,120
I see... so that's how it is.

105
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,580
So this is what a Special
Investigations detective is like.

106
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:38,040
Not your average run-of-the-mill case.

107
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,720
I wonder what kind of
outfit they change into.

108
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,520
Moonlight is my energy!

109
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,180
Messenger from the moon!

110
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:48,780
Gekkō Deka!

111
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:50,700
And likewise, Venus Deka!

112
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:52,820
Currently under inspection.

113
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:58,140
Criminals who disturb the public,

114
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,900
on behalf of the moon, we'll punish you!

115
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:04,900
Ow ow ow!

116
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:06,520
What's the big idea all of a sudden?

117
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,520
It's a ritual for going out on duty.

118
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,380
Why are we wearing sailor uniforms?

119
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,580
These are easier to move
in when chasing criminals.

120
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:18,020
Besides, flashing a little panty has
stunned countless criminals so far.

121
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:21,680
They just got grossed out and collapsed,
that's all!

122
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,020
Alright, everyone, let's head out!

123
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:26,980
You two, change into these too.

124
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:30,620
I have to wear it too?

125
00:08:32,180 --> 00:08:32,580
Naturally.

126
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,660
So that means I'm wearing one too?

127
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:38,600
You and Daijirō look like
a super lovey-dovey couple.

128
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:42,320
Well, if it's a mission,
there's no help for it.

129
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,740
What are you doing, Chief Ohara!

130
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,520
No, I'm not changing into that.

131
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:53,340
You'll stay here as the liaison,
so you can stay as you are.

132
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,680
I see.

133
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,820
Sorry, everyone.

134
00:08:57,820 --> 00:09:00,920
I refuse!
I can catch the criminal like this!

135
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:02,720
There's no way Auntie's coming!

136
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:05,380
Then it can't be helped.
Forced transformation it is.

137
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:07,960
Subordinates who defy
their superior's orders

138
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,140
In the name of the Moon,

139
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,180
Make-up!

140
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,800
I'll go change in the back.

141
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:23,500
Fine, I'll change myself, so let go of me!

142
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,080
I see.

143
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,060
Are you okay, senpai?

144
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:33,620
You were supposed to be sent off,
weren't you?

145
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:36,680
What happened? I thought I
heard a terrible scream just now.

146
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:44,300
Hurry up and put your pants on!

147
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:49,300
It's not like I want to show off, you know!

148
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,800
Then hurry up and transform!

149
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,300
If you keep dawdling,
the culprits will get away!

150
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:55,500
Right.

151
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,260
Make-up!

152
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:01,920
How do I look?

153
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,520
Not bad at all.

154
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,540
Make-up!

155
00:10:07,220 --> 00:10:08,400
So, how does it look?

156
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,120
Yeah, it's not bad.

157
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,940
Like a country schoolgirl
from before the war.

158
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:14,900
Makeover.

159
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:19,120
Like, super cute, kind of.

160
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,080
Chō beri bā!

161
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,960
Totally infuriating!

162
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,660
Nobody uses words like that anymore!

163
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:27,920
Ow!

164
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:30,720
And what are those boxer shorts?!

165
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:32,900
What underwear I wear is my own business!

166
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:35,000
You can't wear boxers with a sailor uniform!

167
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:39,420
Idiot!

168
00:10:41,020 --> 00:10:42,020
I've changed.

169
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,220
What do you think?

170
00:10:49,220 --> 00:10:52,380
Wow! It suits you perfectly!

171
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:54,440
You look just like a real high school girl!

172
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,600
Hee hee, thank you!

173
00:10:55,940 --> 00:10:59,220
But Reiko,
boxers with a sailor uniform just won't do!

174
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,380
What are you thinking?!

175
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:02,480
As if I'd ever wear boxers!

176
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,220
Let's see.

177
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:07,020
Whoa! What are you doing?!

178
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:07,820
Ahhh!

179
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:09,160
Ugh!

180
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:13,500
Ugh! Ugh! Ugh!

181
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:16,600
Geez, yay!

182
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,460
Aaaaaaah!

183
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:27,500
Right, everyone, board the Gekkō! It's a two-seater, but if you cram in, three more can fit.
Three people, one left over.

184
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:34,780
Don't worry, we've prepared a special seat for you.
It's like being locked up in a night fighter.

185
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:42,000
Why does it have to be like this?! Scramble!

186
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:52,560
Yaaah, it's scary!

187
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:57,940
Huh? Stop it! Stop it right now!

188
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:02,160
Did we do it?

189
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:15,560
Let me off! Let me off!

190
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:19,960
Here? We just received word
that the suspects have escaped.

191
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,500
What?

192
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:22,480
No choice, we're returning to base.

193
00:12:30,860 --> 00:12:31,660
It's a Chiyburing.

194
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,480
What are you doing, Chief?

195
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:52,380
Uh there's a deep reason for this, you see.

196
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:42,100
The Econome theft gang's top target: the world
sapphire exhibit being held here right now.

197
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,640
They've announced they'll steal
the Mermaid Princess's Tears.

198
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,920
This is the warning notice.

199
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:53,480
If we'd caught the culprit last night, we
wouldn't have had to come all the way out here.

200
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,380
I'll hear you out.

201
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:59,840
Ryotsu, it's your own fault
for not changing quickly.

202
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:03,000
If you'd changed right away,
we wouldn't have let the suspects get away.

203
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,280
Being told out of nowhere
to put on a sailor uniform...

204
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:07,560
Nobody just says "Oh, okay" and changes.

205
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:10,700
Well, fine.

206
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:13,660
Today I'll finally show you my true ability!

207
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:16,720
You never know where the culprits' eyes are.

208
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,700
Everyone,
disguise yourselves and keep watch.

209
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,300
Eeeh?

210
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,680
Venus Deka, transform!

211
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,820
Moonlight Power!

212
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,420
Makeover

213
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:55,300
Makeover again I guess it's
a makeover this time too.

214
00:14:57,380 --> 00:14:59,920
Allow me to explain: last night's
outfit was for tailing suspects.

215
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,376
Right now, for top-secret security,

216
00:15:01,426 --> 00:15:04,440
we're in the middle of transforming
into ordinary civilians.

217
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,500
Well, I

218
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:10,240
already look like an
ordinary civilian as I am.

219
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:12,820
I don't think I need to transform, though.

220
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:13,700
Mm-hmm.

221
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:18,180
Alright! Costume change complete!

222
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,780
Wedding Gekkō, ta-da!

223
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:30,760
How is that an ordinary civilian?

224
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:35,280
A bride who was abducted by her
ex-lover in the middle of her wedding

225
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:38,400
is supposedly stopping by a
department store while escaping.

226
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,920
It's a common story, right?

227
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:41,060
No way, no way.

228
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:44,940
By the way, wearing this outfit
makes you sensitive to women's gazes

229
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:48,660
so if a woman tries to steal jewels,
you can spot her instantly.

230
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:49,940
Those Cat's Eye thieves!

231
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:51,480
Tonight at last, I'll have you under my -

232
00:15:57,460 --> 00:15:59,160
Look, look, Venus-san.

233
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:01,960
This jewel would look so good on you.

234
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:05,560
It would suit you better, big sis.

235
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:08,940
Venus, you're such a flatterer.

236
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:11,500
If anything, it suits you better.

237
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:15,320
Big sister suits it better.

238
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:18,880
Gives me chills.
This conversation is otherworldly.

239
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,040
It's creepy, isn't it.

240
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:20,320
Hey.

241
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:24,680
Well, we're in no position to talk
about other people's looks either.

242
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:27,260
So we're stuck in these outfits after all?

243
00:16:27,260 --> 00:16:29,200
I never wanted to come back here.

244
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:30,680
What?

245
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,720
What's wrong?

246
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,280
Hurry up and turn on the light!

247
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:39,120
The Mermaid Princess's Tears...

248
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,620
...are gone.

249
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:41,800
This is...

250
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:47,420
It's over there!

251
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,620
You foolish policemen!

252
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:58,200
I've taken the Mermaid Princess's Tears.

253
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:00,180
Well then, adieu!

254
00:17:00,180 --> 00:17:01,220
It's in the building next door!

255
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:02,060
After her, after her!

256
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:03,200
Something's off.

257
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:06,260
There wasn't a single suspicious woman,
I'm sure of it.

258
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:08,140
Anyway, let's go too.

259
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:08,560
Yeah.

260
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,540
Hey, what are you doing?

261
00:17:14,020 --> 00:17:15,560
Playtime's over.

262
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:18,780
Let's show them the true
power of the Gekkō detectives!

263
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:22,600
Chasing blindly will only
let them get away like before.

264
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,240
Transform!

265
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:26,560
Moonlight Power!

266
00:17:28,300 --> 00:17:29,860
Make-up!

267
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:32,040
Venus Down, Kasuna, please.

268
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,040
Yes!

269
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,320
Love Nurse Moonlight Detective!

270
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:38,360
Likewise, Pretty Nurse Venus Detective!

271
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:39,360
Behold!-Behold!

272
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,480
Why are we nurses?!

273
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:42,940
Q-quiet!

274
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:54,220
There's a car speeding
away to the south-southwest.

275
00:17:54,220 --> 00:17:55,760
That's the culprit's car.

276
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,380
Then let's chase after it right away.

277
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,400
Got it.

278
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:00,880
But first, transformation!

279
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,060
Here we go again.

280
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,960
Moonlight Power!

281
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:08,340
Reiker!

282
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:11,000
Your stockings are showing.

283
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:14,440
Poor thing.

284
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,160
So you're Queen Moonlight?

285
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:20,620
So you're Queen Venus?

286
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:21,400
Tenzan.

287
00:18:21,940 --> 00:18:24,660
Hey, what's with that outfit?

288
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:26,960
This one gives better night vision, you see.

289
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:36,960
Not here again.

290
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:39,540
The strength has been
upgraded since last time.

291
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:40,940
No need to worry about crashing.

292
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:41,640
Sortie!

293
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:50,620
Hey! Isn't the takeoff distance too short?!

294
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,880
It's fine, we'll make it work somehow.

295
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,320
What the hell kind of flying is this?!

296
00:19:04,980 --> 00:19:05,600
There it is!

297
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:10,240
Let's go!

298
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:16,620
So flashy, so flashy.

299
00:19:18,620 --> 00:19:19,720
You can't run anymore!

300
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,600
Be good and hand over those farts.

301
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:22,540
Female cat ball

302
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:27,800
Like hell I'll let you go!

303
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,260
You wicked scoundrel!

304
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,740
Climb! Climb higher!

305
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:53,880
Relax, my piloting skills are solid.

306
00:19:57,540 --> 00:19:59,440
I'm not relaxed at all!

307
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:02,980
This is bad.

308
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,220
That was a pure hunch.

309
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:17,140
-Hey! Leaving your post without permission!
-If I hadn't left, I'd be dead!

310
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:30,980
-Idiot!-There's a dead end ahead!

311
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:39,560
What the hell!

312
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:45,280
They're planning to escape through the sky!

313
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:47,260
Look at that, it's pretty big.

314
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:52,420
Are they your buddies?

315
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:54,760
Jump onto that airship, Ryotsu!

316
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:58,400
Stop them before they get on board!

317
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:01,560
Come on, it's only three women.
You can do it.

318
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,720
Don't joke around!

319
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,220
If I fail to jump across,
I'll die, you know!

320
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,660
You'll get double the special bonus!

321
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:09,920
Double the special bonus.

322
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:10,860
Got it.

323
00:21:10,860 --> 00:21:12,522
For the sake of the world and its people,

324
00:21:12,572 --> 00:21:15,140
I'll arrest the culprit myself,
no matter what!

325
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:16,480
Alright, let's go!

326
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:23,100
Next, let me take over
and give you a punishment!

327
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:27,160
You bitch's brat, I'll take care of you!

328
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:30,038
This what's-it, this

329
00:21:30,088 --> 00:21:32,600
Ma, ma, ma, ma, ma, Bust Claw!

330
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:36,480
Wh-what?

331
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:39,906
These guys,
Mom's gonna take their masks off,

332
00:21:39,956 --> 00:21:42,440
Direct hit on this NX, you!

333
00:22:15,060 --> 00:22:17,860
Oh my god, these guys were all men?

334
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:20,640
Dressing up as women,
how disgusting these guys are.

335
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:22,300
Like you're one to talk.

336
00:22:24,980 --> 00:22:25,960
Mission accomplished.

337
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,900
I hear you did a great job, Ryotsu.

338
00:22:34,460 --> 00:22:37,340
Well, when I get serious,
that kind of thing is a piece of cake.

339
00:22:37,940 --> 00:22:42,460
So the Cat's Eye thieves were disguised
as women to throw off the investigation?

340
00:22:42,820 --> 00:22:45,170
Since the investigators
also assumed they were women,

341
00:22:45,220 --> 00:22:47,260
they were hard to catch

342
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,700
Bonus, double, double!

343
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,940
A delivery from the Special Crimes Division.

344
00:22:54,940 --> 00:22:56,220
Here it comes!

345
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:58,880
A cardboard box?

346
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:00,200
It's awfully big.

347
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,320
There's a letter inside.

348
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:13,620
As a special bonus for solving this case,

349
00:23:13,620 --> 00:23:16,360
we're sending you special custom
figures of the special detectives.

350
00:23:16,360 --> 00:23:19,380
These are rare items you
can't get anywhere else.

351
00:23:19,780 --> 00:23:22,202
Kaipan Deka, Dolphin Deka,

352
00:23:22,252 --> 00:23:24,560
and us, Gekkō Deka and Venus Deka,

353
00:23:25,380 --> 00:23:28,000
and to honor your
outstanding work this time,

354
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,820
we've also custom-made a figure
of Patrol Sergeant Ryotsu.

355
00:23:31,820 --> 00:23:33,580
Please treasure them.

356
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:37,120
If you don't display them in your room,
you'll be punished.

357
00:23:38,220 --> 00:23:41,800
After all, Ryo-chan pretty much
solved this case all by himself.

358
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,160
This one's for Ryo-chan.

359
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,480
Mine too, right?

360
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:45,400
Mine too.

361
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,540
Here, Senpai, take them all.

362
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:52,000
I worked my heart out for this.

363
00:23:52,460 --> 00:23:54,020
And this is the result?

364
00:23:54,020 --> 00:23:55,960
This is the double bonus?

365
00:23:56,600 --> 00:23:58,840
Even junk like this can fetch a good price,
you know.

366
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:03,580
What?

367
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:09,140
Terai's buying a dud bomb?

368
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,720
So that's what he's up to.

369
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:13,640
He really is a secret weapons nut,
just like he looks.

370
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,380
Really.

371
00:24:14,380 --> 00:24:16,440
We have to get this dud bomb

372
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:18,060
back to the police box no matter what!

373
00:24:18,460 --> 00:24:20,540
I'll deliver the dud bomb next time.

374
00:24:20,540 --> 00:24:21,620
Take care of it, okay?

375
00:24:37,580 --> 00:24:43,840
Make some noise, the timing's right,
solved in a flash, settled quick

376
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:55,700
decided by inspiration, bouncing along,
gathered together, taking action, flying off

377
00:24:56,640 --> 00:25:00,780
Most of all, incredible power

378
00:25:00,780 --> 00:25:06,460
Everyone, gather, if you come here

379
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:12,760
Like a dream, the ultimate energy

380
00:25:13,700 --> 00:25:17,120
Gazing at tomorrow,
the great new land of the nation

381
00:25:17,120 --> 00:25:20,020
Painting the universe,
if you stand on the ground

382
00:25:20,020 --> 00:25:23,840
Kameari's star spun around and drew a circle

383
00:25:25,940 --> 00:25:27,500
This should be good enough, right?

384
00:25:27,500 --> 00:25:29,040
Like hell it is, you idiot!

385
00:25:38,580 --> 00:25:41,680
Thank you for watching.

